        <content type="html" xml:base="https://spitlo.com/code/spitlo-com/">&lt;p&gt;I made this site mainly to improve my HTML and UI skills, having done mostly React and back-end work the last few years.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I also wanted to try out &lt;a rel=&quot;noopener nofollow noreferrer external&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; href=&quot;https://www.getzola.org/&quot;&gt;Zola&lt;/a&gt; and get away from JavaScript for a while.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lastly, it’s a nice low-stakes place to have some fun and try stuff out, for example:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Github Pages hosting with a custom domain name&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Github Actions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hand coded or programmatically generated SVGs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Undocumented CSS stuff like animating the &lt;code&gt;content&lt;/code&gt; value of &lt;code&gt;::before&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;::after&lt;/code&gt; pseudo-elements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newer/partially supported HTML elements like &lt;code&gt;&amp;lt;details&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ever so slightly dipping my toes into the Rust ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Using AVIF&lt;a rel=&quot;noopener nofollow noreferrer external&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/getzola/zola/issues/1202&quot;&gt;?&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</content>
        
